The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository.

Two kinds of third-party file ship alongside it and keep their own terms:

  * public/sfx/*.ogg      nine sound recordings, CC0 1.0 (public domain).
                          Sources listed in public/sfx/CREDITS.md.

  * public/fonts/*.woff2  Baloo 2 and Nunito, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
                          Licence text in public/fonts/OFL-Baloo2.txt and
                          public/fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt, as that licence
                          requires.

Everything else — every texture, every material, the environment map, the
glaze chemistry, the kiln and the music — is generated by the code here.
